axes of the heart, calculated with CentralAxes.\n\nOutput is het fiber angle \
matrix FAM = {9, slice, x, y} or {FAM, plot}.\nThe angles are in degrees. \n\n\
HelixAngleCalc[] is based on DOI: 10.1186/1532-429X-17-S1-P15.", 
