         {
          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"FindCoilPosition[weights] finds the coil posision \
by locating the highest intensity location in the coil weight map, which can \
be obtianed by LoadCoilSetup or SumOfSquares.\\nInternally it uses \
MakeWeightMask to remove the noise of the \
weightmasks.\\nFindCoilPosition[weights, mask] limits the search region to \
