jcoup values {{n1, nx}, j} between nuclei.\nMakeSpinSystem[{name,labs}, \
freqs, jcoup] same but each nuclei has a specific name, e.g.{\"ATP\", {\"\
\[Gamma]\",\"\[Alpha]\",\"\[Beta]\"}.\nMakeSpinSystem[name, freqs, jcoup, \
scales] same but each nuclei has a scale, default scales are 1.\n\
MakeSpinSystem[{name,labs}, freqs, jcoup, scales] same as alle before.", 
    "Documentation" -> <|"Local" -> "paclet:QMRITools/ref/MakeSpinSystem"|>, 
    "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None, "DownValues" -> None, 
