  InformationData[<|
   "ObjectType" -> "Symbol", "Usage" -> 
    "SequenceSpaceEcho[din, ham, t1, t2, necho, b1] performs a multi echo \
spin echo experiment with a 90 degree spin echo, with t1 the time between the \
90 degree RF pulse and the first 180 degree RF pulse, \nt2 the time betwteen \
a 180 degree RF pulse and the following readout (and 2xt1 the time between \
two consecutive 180 degree RF pulses.\nFurther defines necho the number of \
180 degree RF pulses, din the spin system given the hamiltonian ham using b1.\
\nThe t1 and t2 are defined in ms, and b1 of 100% is defines as 1.\nThe \
output is a new spinsystem dout.", 
