{xn,yn,zn}} without the unweighted gradient direction.\\nbvalue is a singe \
number indicating the b-value used.\\nTensorCalc[data, gradients, bvec] \
calculates the diffusion tensor for the given dataset. allows for multiple \
unweighted images and multiple bvalues.\\nallows for differnt tensor fitting \
methods. gradient directions must be in the form {{x1,y1,z1}, ..., \
