dataset. allows for multiple unweighted images and multiple bvalues.\nbmat is \
the bmatrix which can be generated usiong Bmatrix.\n\nThe bvalue assumed to \
be is in s/mm^2 and therfore the output is in mm^2/2.\n\nTensorCalc[] is \
